{"recordId":"minister_范雎_2004243205","name":"范雎","type":"minister","dynasty":"戰國","title":"應侯","canonicalName":null,"aliases":[],"identityStatus":"candidate","candidatePages":[{"title":"范雎","pageId":304624,"revisionId":94028494,"revisionTimestamp":"2026-08-24T14:08:05Z","url":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%8C%83%E9%9B%8E","revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94028494","wikidataId":"Q845535","isDisambiguation":false,"bibliography":[{"citationTitle":"秦始皇51岁驾崩？《史记》记错了","url":"http://cul.jschina.com.cn/system/2013/11/30/019472682.shtml","type":"citation-template","template":"Cite web","author":"","publisher":"中国江苏网","date":"2013-11-30","isbn":"","locator":"citation template"},{"citationTitle":"教授耗时8年为《史记》挑错：秦始皇没活到51岁","url":"http://www.chinanews.com/cul/2013/11-30/5564826.shtml","type":"citation-template","template":"Cite news","author":"","publisher":"扬子晚报","date":"2013-11-30","isbn":"","locator":"citation template"},{"citationTitle":"史记","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"战国策·秦策三","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"编年纪","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"}],"wikisourceLinks":[],"retrievedAt":"2026-10-02T10:34:03.909Z","attribution":{"source":"Chinese Wikipedia contributors","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0; bibliography metadata only","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","status":"candidate index, not independently verified evidence"}}],"sourceIds":["source:hanshu","source:houhanshu","source:zizhitongjian","source:zhanguoce"],"reviewIds":[],"claimIds":[],"matches":[{"documentId":"document:hanshu-eb969eba8b9bb8ea","query":"范雎","count":1,"offset":21816,"excerpt":"：「瑳音子何持，即景差也。」〕\n|　　\n\n　　　燕昭王〔三十九世，噲子。〕\n| 范雎　　燕惠王〔四十世，昭王子。〕\n| 騎劫　\n\n　　樂毅　郭隗　葉陽君　秦昭襄王〔武王弟。〕\n| 韓釐王〔襄王子。〕\n|　\n\n　　　白起　　穰侯　　　\n\n　　　田","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:hanshu-703e7b4ce1bf5dcf","query":"范雎","count":1,"offset":9467,"excerpt":"不肖，入朝見嫉。昔司馬喜臏腳於宋，卒相中山；〔蘇林曰：「六國時人，被此刑也。」〕范雎拉脅折齒於魏，卒爲應侯。〔應劭曰：「魏人也。魏相魏齊疑其以國陰事告齊，乃掠笞數百，拉脅折齒。」師古曰：「後入秦爲相，封爲應侯。拉，摧也，音盧合反。」〕此二人者，","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:hanshu-42c10823b2c0a5c2","query":"范雎","count":2,"offset":4427,"excerpt":"而周公懼。穰侯，昭王之舅也，權重於秦，威震鄰敵，有旦莫偃伏之愛，心不介然有間，然范雎起徒步，由異國，無雅信，開一朝之說，而穰侯就封。及近者武安侯之見退，三事之跡，相去各數百歲，若合符節，甚不可不察。願將軍由周公之謙懼，損穰侯之威，放武安之欲，毋","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:hanshu-c5e36c6c0a44f6a7","query":"范雎","count":2,"offset":8317,"excerpt":"而殷虛，二老歸而周熾，子胥死而吳亡，種、蠡存而粵伯，五羖入而秦喜，樂毅出而燕懼，范雎以折摺而危穰侯，蔡澤雖噤吟而咲唐舉。故當其有事也，非蕭、曹、子房、平、勃、樊、霍則不能安；當其亡事也，章句之徒相與坐而守之，亦亡所患。故世亂，則聖哲馳騖而不足；","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:houhanshu-8e33b3b4d05cf473","query":"范雎","count":1,"offset":8832,"excerpt":"以徇吳，李通誅宗族以從漢之類也。〕及至其敝，睚眦之怨必讎，一餐之惠必報。〔史記，范雎一餐之德必償，睚眦之怨必報。〕故鼂錯念國，遘禍於袁盎；〔景帝時，錯爲御史大夫，以諸侯國大，請削其土。吳楚七國反，以誅錯爲名。袁盎素與錯不相善，盎乃進說，請斬錯以","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:zizhitongjian-e937ad51d324cc86","query":"范雎","count":2,"offset":1635,"excerpt":"而存先王之宗廟也。事無大小，上及太后，下至大臣，願先生悉以教寡人，無疑寡人也！」范雎拜，王亦拜。范睢曰：「以秦國之大，士卒之勇，以治諸侯，譬若走韓盧而博蹇兔也。而閉關十五年，不敢窺兵於山東者，是穰侯為秦謀不忠，而大王之計亦有所失也。」王跽曰：「","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:zizhitongjian-ffdf49fe90cb6a2d","query":"范雎","count":1,"offset":8822,"excerpt":"廷。杜欽見鳳專政泰重，戒之曰：「願將軍由周公之謙懼，損穰侯之威，放武安之欲，毋使范雎之徒得間其說。」鳳不聽。\n\n時上無繼嗣，體常不平。定陶共王來朝，太后與上承先帝意，遇共王甚厚，賞賜十倍於它王，不以往事為纖介；留之京師，不遣歸國。上謂共王：「我","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:zhanguoce-f71b8acb7f7cc83b","query":"范雎","count":22,"offset":33729,"excerpt":"是纆牽長也〔未展開模板：{{SK notes|亦在韓䇿詳二臣之言則戎之寵少衰矣故范雎得而間之}}〕\n　　〔未展開模板：{{SK anchor|范子}}〕〔未展開模板：{{SK notes|名雎字叔後封應侯凡范皆晉舊姓故史云魏人}}〕因王稽〔未展","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:zhanguoce-87f377a2bef0698c","query":"范雎","count":1,"offset":18379,"excerpt":"王為是之故十七年事秦秦正告韓曰我起乎少曲〔未展開模板：{{SK notes|韓地范雎傳伐韓少曲}}〕一日而斷太行我起乎宜陽而觸平陽二日而莫不盡繇我〔未展開模板：{{SK notes|繇由同}}〕離兩周而觸鄭五日而國舉韓氏以為然故事秦秦正告魏曰我","matchType":"name-occurrence"}],"matchCount":9,"gaps":["身份連結尚未完成編輯核對；同名、異名或同時代關係可能有誤配。","原人物分析及能力數值尚未逐句核對。","來源中的年代、關係與評價仍需逐條轉成有出處的主張。"],"notes":["姓名／重新導向命中，人物身份與每條書目尚須逐項核對。","姓名、分類、時代及稱號保留原庫資料，不自動視為史實。"],"version":"b66c5a60a41e2334","matchedDocuments":[{"id":"document:hanshu-eb969eba8b9bb8ea","bookId":"book:hanshu","requestedTitle":"漢書/卷020","title":"漢書/卷020","sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%BC%A2%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B7020","revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2117895","historyUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%BC%A2%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B7020?action=history","revisionId":2117895,"revisionTimestamp":"2022-03-27T12:27:09Z","retrievedAt":"2026-10-02T10:36:02.073Z","sha256":"2ff5dbae42461eb5f2f4ab338de77bc67c8be89059051ee9e05e2c70798018a3","textSha256":"50edb6dfa53db0e3049c444f1c4fc2fb7fd50d64ecf4858d4f15f117f362db09","expandedWikitextSha256":"2ff5dbae42461eb5f2f4ab338de77bc67c8be89059051ee9e05e2c70798018a3","characters":22611,"contentPath":"/static/data/history/archive-books/hanshu.json","status":"downloaded","acquisitionStatus":"downloaded","reuse":"Ancient underlying text; Wikisource transcription attribution and CC BY-SA 4.0 for applicable contributions","extraction":"wikitext-conservative-v2.1.0","normalizedAt":"2026-10-02T11:14:35.242Z","upstreamTextQuality":null,"upstreamTextQualityMeaning":"Wikisource platform quality marker; not a percentage of text transcribed","textCompleteness":"not-independently-collated","extractionNotes":[],"expandedTransclusionTitles":[],"transclusionIssues":[],"transclusions":[],"textPath":"/static/data/history/web/releases/b66c5a60a41e2334/documents/402356160ad9210fd753.json","wikitextPath":"/static/data/history/web/releases/b66c5a60a41e2334/wikitext/402356160ad9210fd753.json","relatedDocumentIds":[]},{"id":"document:hanshu-703e7b4ce1bf5dcf","bookId":"book:hanshu","requestedTitle":"漢書/卷051","title":"漢書/卷051","sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%BC%A2%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B7051","revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.